# Model Card / System Card

## Project Name

CFD-LLM Case Setup Assistant

## Intended Use

A technical assistant for early-stage CFD case setup, troubleshooting and documentation planning.

## Intended Users

- aerospace engineering students
- CFD beginners/intermediate users
- simulation portfolio developers
- engineers preparing verification reports

## Strengths

- practical CFD workflow reasoning
- convergence and mesh sensitivity guidance
- structured answer format
- lightweight local execution
- extensible RAG architecture

## Limitations

- not a replacement for solver documentation
- not a validated expert system
- no automatic mesh inspection
- no direct CFD solver execution
- current retrieval is keyword-based
- answers depend on the curated knowledge base

## Safety Notes

The assistant should not be used to make certification, flight safety or production design decisions without expert review and validated simulation evidence.
